            "review_title": "Review at Buffet Poseidon Gold Coast Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Patrick J\nKo Samui, Thailand23 contributions\n0\nWhile shopping at Gold Coast, we decided to have dinner at this large restaurant on the top floor of the Mall.\nJun 2026 • Couples\nSimply inedible! A nice colorful buffet, but the shrimp and squid are dry and cold, the sushi rice is frozen, the small dark gray crabs inside, the fries are hard and cold, the spaghetti is overcooked! The only thing that is expensive is the bill, and of course, only in cash 🙏\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten June 22, 2026",
